        "prompt": "=/Compare the new test cases:\n{{ $('LLM: Generate TCs (JSON)').item.json[\"text\"] }}\n\nwith existing Allure test cases:\n{{ $json[\"content\"] }}\n\nIdentify and remove duplicates, validate relevance to TS. Return filtered JSON test cases."
